          <div class="relative z-20">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
              <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#00FF88] bg-[#00FF88]/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-[#00FF88]/25">
                PresciaIQ Programmatic // Scalable
              </span>
              <span class="text-[#00FF88] text-xs font-mono">Infrastructural</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-semibold text-[#F0EDE6] mb-3 group-hover:text-[#00FF88] transition-colors">
              The Programmatic Advantage
            </h3>
            <p class="text-[#C9CCC8] text-sm font-sans leading-relaxed mb-6">
              Instead of manually writing a few pages a month, we build a scalable programmatic architecture. We take your core offerings and cross-reference them with every possible location you serve, every industry you operate in, and every specific problem your customers are trying to solve.
            </p>
          </div>
          <ul class="relative z-20 space-y-2.5 pt-4 border-t border-white/5 text-xs font-mono text-[#00FF88]">
